  "body": "[GEMglTexParameterf] calls glTexParameterf() each time a gemlist passes through it, with the parameters set by its creation arguments and inlets. GL constants are numbers here: [GLdefine] turns a name like GL_LINES into its value. See glTexParameter in the OpenGL reference."
